# Local config + secrets — never commit
# .env is the one secret file this product asks YOU to create (your X bearer token, and
# optionally your CoinGecko / CoinMarketCap keys). It was missing from this list until
# 2026-08-29, which is exactly the file most likely to end up in a public repo by accident.
.env
.env.*
!env.example
.mcp.json
config.json
*.key

# Caches + generated
.screen-cache.json
.runup-hits.json
usage.log.jsonl
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Your private research output (keep your own, don't ship)
reports/*
!reports/.gitkeep
